Z||000004||Haze_Performance||12-15-2001||11:30 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroMontreal:<BR><B>anyone know any other meusems with Fieros in em?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>The sign behind the car says that the original Indy 500 Pace Car is in the Indy 500 Museum in Indianapolis. I thought some said it wasn't there?? I'm not sure. I'm going to call the Museum Monday & ask them.. (One more road trip)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><BR>One bit of bad news about the Pace Car. I inspected the wheels & found that yes Centerline made them but.... The flat center part of the wheel looks like a cover. Its not a complete solid wheel. If you look in the holes you can see another wheel behind it..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rear_tire.jpg"> Rear<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rear_tire3.jpg"> Rear<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rear_tire5.jpg"> Rear<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/front_tire2.jpg"> Front<P>P.S. Tire size:<BR>Front - GoodYear VR50 225/50/ZR16<BR>Rear - GoodYear VR50 255/50ZR16<P>||||reg||14
