Z||000037||Hartz||12-17-2001||08:26 PM||||The PPG pace cars were used for CART races while PPG was the title sponsor of that series (pre-Fed Ex days).  They were all heavily modified cars.  I think all of the drivers were female, too.<P>That picture is one I took at the national FOCOA show maybe back in '93-'95?  I forget what year it was exactly...  It was whatever year the show was at PMD headquarters in Pontiac, Michigan.<P>Unfortunately, I don't have any other pictures of that car.<P>On a completely random note, though - did anyone notice the little red coupe in the background?  One cyber-beer for the first person to tell me "what is wrong with this picture" and why.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Hartz<P><p>[This message has been edited by Hartz (edited 12-17-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000038||Haze_Performance||12-17-2001||08:42 PM||||    <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Hartz:<BR><B><BR>On a completely random note, though - did anyone notice the little red coupe in the background?  One cyber-beer for the first person to tell me "what is wrong with this picture" and why.        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Hartz<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Lets see... The Lug nuts are shiney.. (No black caps)<P>It might be the pic but the rear wheel looks smaller..    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> (because it wouldnt fit on the car hauler ???) I dont have a clue here  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>No "SE" on the 1/4 window... (I'm grasping at straws here   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> )<P><p>[This message has been edited by Haze_Performance (edited 12-17-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000039||Hartz||12-17-2001||08:51 PM||||Haze - Good catch on the lug nuts - I hadn't noticed *that* one.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>HINT:  The rear window may look odd in proportions for a reason.  There is a reference point that is missing.<P>Hartz||||reg||1
